-- examples/expected_fail/match_nonexhaustive_bool.ail
--
-- M-V1-MATCH-EXHAUSTIVENESS: a match that misses a case is a compile error.
-- `ailang check` must reject this with
--   TC_MATCH_002: non-exhaustive match on bool — no arm matches: false
-- (It used to pass with a warning and fail at run time.) The accepted twin
-- is examples/runnable/match_exhaustiveness.ail.
match true {
  true => "yes"
}
